00:55:01.240 --> 00:55:06.360
The labyrinth of large tunnels that constitutes a well-established badger set is unmistakable.

00:55:07.000 --> 00:55:09.520
The Badgers spend much time maintaining it.

00:55:10.040 --> 00:55:13.320
The bedding which they take underground needs constant renewing.

00:55:13.690 --> 00:55:18.430
