00:55:26.070 --> 00:55:27.750
All this activity around the set.

00:55:27.990 --> 00:55:29.730
makes badgers ideal subjects.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:31.120
for watching animal behaviour.

00:55:43.140 --> 00:55:48.600
A great mountain of bedding at a set indicates the likelihood that there's a family of cubs down below.

00:55:49.290 --> 00:55:58.430
This could be a good set to watch, but if you decide to do this, never walk over the set and always wait downwind, arriving well before the badgers are likely to emerge.

00:55:59.210 --> 00:55:59.950
And if it's private,

