Meeting the cold air above shows that there's life underground.

00:56:15.220 --> 00:56:17.480
Badgers usually live in family groups.

00:56:17.820 --> 00:56:23.780
And as they emerge one by one, there is usually a certain amount of scratching and grooming, sometimes of each other.

00:56:25.180 --> 00:56:26.700
And then, if they're cubs,

00:56:27.260 --> 00:56:27.960
There will be play.

00:56:35.240 --> 00:56:38.960
It's difficult to imagine a nicer way of enjoying our countryside

00:56:38.960 --> 00:56:42.160
